@startuml DataFlow_v2
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
title Flujo de Datos - Bio-Sincronización y Motor Cognitivo

actor "Usuario" as User
participant "App / UI" as UI
participant "useEngineStore" as Store
participant "googleFit.ts" as FitService
participant "calculator.ts" as CalcEngine
participant "Firestore" as DB
participant "MasterChart" as View

== Sincronización de Salud (Google Fit) ==
User -> UI : Pulsa "Refrescar" o Cambia Fecha
UI -> Store : loadFitnessData()
Store -> FitService : fetchFitnessData(token, date)

activate FitService
FitService -> FitService : mergeSleepIntervals()\n(Triple Verificación)
FitService --> Store : FitnessData {sleep, steps, bpm}
deactivate FitService

Store -> CalcEngine : calculateDailyPerformance(logs, baseIq, fitness)
CalcEngine --> Store : ChartDataPoint {iqBase, iqFitness, iqBoost}
Store --> View : Renderiza desgloses y curva

== Manejo de Expiración (Token Refresh) ==
Store -> FitService : fetch (recibe 401 UNAUTHORIZED)
Store -> FB : refreshGoogleFitToken()
FB --> Store : setFitToken(newToken)
Store -> Store : loadFitnessData() (auto-retry)

== Analítica Semanal (Tendencias) ==
User -> UI : Cambia a pestaña "Tendencias"
UI -> Store : setActiveView('analytics')
Store -> Store : loadWeeklyFitnessData()
Store -> FitService : fetch múltiple (7 días)
FitService --> Store : Record<Date, FitnessData>
Store --> UI : Renderiza AnalyticsDashboard

== Ajuste Manual de Sueño ==
User -> UI : Click +0.5h / -0.5h
UI -> Store : updateManualSleep(delta)
Store -> DB : sync manualSleepAdjustment
Store -> Store : recalculate()
Store --> View : Actualización inmediata del CI

== Registro de suplementos ==
User -> UI : Selecciona Favorito o Busca Nootrópico
UI -> Store : addLog(suppId, time, qty)
Store -> DB : setDoc(logs)
Store -> Store : recalculate()
Store --> View : Actualiza curva con impacto farmacocinético

== Visibilidad de Logs ==
User -> UI : Toggle "Ojo" (Ocultar)
UI -> Store : toggleLogVisibility(logId)
Store -> CalcEngine : Filtra logs.hidden === false
Store -> Store : recalculate()
Store --> View : Muestra impacto del retiro del suplemento

@enduml
